1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
[Instrumental music]

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,800
Left: original. Right: WebScaly.

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,900
Same video. More detail.
640×360 source, Anime4K.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
WebScaly
Local video enhancement for Chrome.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
On your graphics card,
only on websites you approve.

6
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,800
Low-resolution video looks soft
on a big screen.

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,500
WebScaly upscales and sharpens it
live, on your device.

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:18,900
Step 1: Allow a website.
Access starts off. You choose where.

9
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,100
Chrome asks once. Choose Allow.

10
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,600
Step 2: Pick an engine.
WebScaly suggests one.

11
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,000
Anime4K for animation,
FSRCNNX for camera footage.

12
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,200
Step 3: Compare in the player.
Drag the split.

13
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,200
The website's own player keeps
playback and sound.

14
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:36,200
Three engines. One frame, same crop.
Anime4K and FSRCNNX need WebGPU.

15
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:40,500
Spatial Detail, the lightest engine,
for any kind of video.

16
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:44,800
FSRCNNX: learned 2× upscaling
for detail in real camera footage.

17
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:47,580
Tune the picture: sharpening, denoise,
deband and colour.

18
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:50,380
A live before-and-after preview.
Saved for each website.

19
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:52,380
Smart by default.
Steps down to keep playback smooth.

20
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:54,080
Pause everywhere, save battery.

21
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:55,780
Shortcuts: Alt+Shift+E turns it on or off.

22
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:57,380
An optional HUD shows live stats.

23
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,580
Runs on your device.
Only on websites you approve.

24
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:01,580
No accounts. No tracking. No uploads.

25
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,980
WebScaly. Free and open source.
Get it on the Chrome Web Store.

26
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:05,480
Source code: github.com/Lorcuz/WebScaly

27
